# This directory is generated by Purview.EventSourcing during build so AI agents can discover the bundled skill.
# Keep this .gitignore checked in so the generated SKILL.md stays out of source control
# and updates to Purview.EventSourcing don't cause unnecessary changes to your repository.
# To disable skill generation, set <EnableEmbeddedAgentSkills>false</EnableEmbeddedAgentSkills>
# in your project file or Directory.Build.props.
*
!.gitignore
